WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.812 --> 00:00:05.657
This is the Hub: your whole class on one board.

2
00:00:05.757 --> 00:00:08.726
Your area is at the top. Everyone can see it.

3
00:00:08.826 --> 00:00:11.557
Below it, every student has a desk.

4
00:00:11.657 --> 00:00:14.316
Start class, and everyone comes to the Hub.

5
00:00:14.416 --> 00:00:21.880
Tap a lesson, then a desk.

6
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:27.656
Or drag a game onto a desk.

7
00:00:27.756 --> 00:00:33.200
Or hand it to the whole class at once.

8
00:00:33.338 --> 00:00:36.686
Each desk shows what the student has open, live.

9
00:00:36.786 --> 00:00:41.282
Tap a desk to look closer.

10
00:00:41.382 --> 00:00:45.721
A raised hand goes in the help queue.

11
00:00:45.821 --> 00:00:50.907
Tap Answered when you have helped.

12
00:00:51.007 --> 00:00:53.357
Today's plan is ready. Start it when class begins.

13
00:00:53.457 --> 00:00:57.883
The Now bar shows the part you are on and the time left.

14
00:00:57.983 --> 00:01:07.976
Give a point for teamwork. Students see their own points, never a ranking.

15
00:01:08.076 --> 00:01:11.667
Start a live game without leaving the Hub.

16
00:01:11.806 --> 00:01:18.533
Students tap Join on their desks. No codes to type.

17
00:01:18.704 --> 00:01:23.967
Hand out a manipulative too.

18
00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:32.409
Watch each student build it, piece by piece.

19
00:01:32.552 --> 00:01:39.442
Students see only their own desk, on any device.

20
00:01:39.492 --> 00:01:49.355
Ask Oomba to draft a day plan.

21
00:01:49.455 --> 00:01:52.874
It uses your groups and games. Nothing goes on desks until you say so.

22
00:01:52.974 --> 00:01:58.309
Save it for tomorrow, and ask for it again any day.

23
00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:02.400
The Hub. Available with the Teacher plan.
